#: picard/script/functions.py:371
#, fuzzy, python-format
#| msgid ""
#| "`$setmulti(name,value,separator=\"; \")`\n"
#| "\n"
#| "Sets the variable `name` to `value`, using the separator (or \"; \" if "
#| "not passed)\n"
#| "    to coerce the value back into a proper multi-valued tag. This can be "
